{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/420c6c0c8d04eda983c9f9c4774b6420.poster.avif?t=1767974773\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/420c6c0c8d04eda983c9f9c4774b6420.webm?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/420c6c0c8d04eda983c9f9c4774b6420.mp4?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>White Knuckle is a first person roguelite speed-climbing game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use momentum-based movement mechanics with precision, deploy a variety of tools and resources, and ascend as fast as you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don't lose your grip, there\u2019s eternity below you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/7dc906b470601b0a6e4b936f03c4244d.poster.avif?t=1767974773\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/7dc906b470601b0a6e4b936f03c4244d.webm?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/7dc906b470601b0a6e4b936f03c4244d.mp4?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your inventory or become encumbered and fall to your death. Failure to grab what you need from your bag in time can spell disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/a0b09be3cef913e5b97232999dbb39da.poster.avif?t=1767974773\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/a0b09be3cef913e5b97232999dbb39da.webm?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/a0b09be3cef913e5b97232999dbb39da.mp4?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through run-based meta-progression, you\u2019ll discover and unlock varied augmentations.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolster your will to ascend.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/1c0f0110e8bc717e6a0131718b7a1a06.poster.avif?t=1767974773\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/1c0f0110e8bc717e6a0131718b7a1a06.webm?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195790/extras/1c0f0110e8bc717e6a0131718b7a1a06.mp4?t=1767974773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're not alone down here.</strong> Strange life flourishes far underground, and darker things haunt these halls. Something oozes from the depths\u2013 following you, growing angrier\u2026 and it won't let up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through different regions with unique threats and gameplay challenges during your attempted escape of the underground megastructure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deep dry storage of the Silos, the putrid sewers of the Pipeworks, the haunted piers of Habitation. Each area will require adaptation to new obstacles and denizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Accidental Hire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/e6581616f2ddefd4f8d0cd4522b46d625ddacfeb.jpg"},{"name":"Urban Boulderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/4ebefcb48b1668cf99c4b047d0226c236de779d2.jpg"},{"name":"Proficient Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/5ce2aed5b5c5f0b2d97ffde553cd2c5ab2184474.jpg"},{"name":"Talented Scaler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/124d23f2a04d9c52d6c37b1142c910f4d806551d.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Clamberer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/30f6120b37dff93edcbbb29d3939c812eb481ad7.jpg"},{"name":"Master Free-Soloist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/2ed33ee5e235af0e4771a1dc5197bc182a37ed0a.jpg"},{"name":"Probably Not Possible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/8207763ba3e1780d16112cbae5c1766746e272ca.jpg"},{"name":"Plumber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/b5e6eab6fc6a538df0455c1d69fa00ee70a1b63b.jpg"},{"name":"How Deep Are We?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/4830737d982465dd4baca3082e31342d27b307f6.jpg"},{"name":"Clocking out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195790/53a0c50755deef964e1fef952019d860c3f8553c.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195790?t=1767974773","background_raw":"htt